# ── Internal R&D docs guard ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# docs/ 是公开产品契约文档（只允许 LECTURECAST-SYSTEM-BOUNDARY / LOCAL-* /
# NARRATION-TIMING-CONTRACT / SIGNING-KEYRING / SUPPORTED-PLATFORMS 6 份）。
# 研发过程文档（设计稿/盲预测/审阅/进度/复盘/UAT/经验清单）只准进私有仓
# lecturecast-server/docs/internal/。以下命名模式一律 ignore，防误提交。
*-design.md
*-DESIGN.md
DIGITAL-HUMAN-*
uat-*
*-RETRO*
*-retro*
COMMERCIAL-WORKFLOW-*
# 目录级守卫：任何内部研发目录（含子路径）一律 ignore
docs/internal/
docs/design/
docs/rfc/
docs/notes/
docs/scratch/
docs/archive/
docs/retro/

# Local-workflow runtime artifacts (templates/remotion is committed source only)
templates/remotion/node_modules/
templates/remotion/out/
templates/remotion/public/narration.mp3
templates/remotion/public/director/
# A course run's working dir (scripts/audio/assets/output live outside the repo
# under ~/lecturecast-projects/<topic>/, but ignore them if created in-tree)
/audio/
/assets/
/output/
